Control Flow Statements
Control flow statements are used to control flow of execution

Control flow statements are 3 types Types
-----------------------------------------
1-Conditional Stmts
-----------------
    if
    if else
    elif
    Multiple if
    Nested if
2-Looping Stmts
---------------
    Range Based → for
    Condition Based → while
3-Transfer Stmts
----------------
    break
    continue

1. if
------
-If you want to execute certain statements based on condition then use if.
Example-
a = int(input("Enter any Number: "))
if(a >= 5):
    a = a + 3
    print(a)
Testcases-
Input: 7 → Output: 10
Input: 4 → Output: 4
Input: 5 → Output: 8

2. if-else
----------
-If you want to execute only one set out of more than two sets then use if-else.

Example-1
Q)Program: Check Even or Odd
    n = int(input("Enter any Number: "))
    if(n % 2 == 0):
        print("Even Number")
    else:
        print("Odd Number")

Example-2
Program: Voting Eligibility

    age = int(input("Enter Age: "))
    if(age >= 18):
        print("Eligible for vote")
    else:
        print("Not Eligible for vote")

Example-3
Program: Pass or Fail (3 Subjects)
    s1 = int(input("Enter sub-1 Marks: "))
    s2 = int(input("Enter sub-2 Marks: "))
    s3 = int(input("Enter sub-3 Marks: "))
    
    if s1>=35 and s2>=35 and s3>=35:
        total = s1 + s2 + s3
        avg = total/3
        print("Total is:", total)
        print("Avg is:", avg)
    else:
        print("Better Luck Next Time")

3. elif
--------
-If you want to execute only one set out of more than two sets then use elif.
Example-1
---------
Program: Positive, Negative or Zero
n = int(input("Enter any Number: "))
if n > 0:
    print("+ve Number")
elif n < 0:
    print("-ve Number")
else:
    print("Zero")

Example-2
----------
Program: Biggest of 3 Numbers
a = int(input("Enter any Number: "))
b = int(input("Enter any Number: "))
c = int(input("Enter any Number: "))

if a>b and a>c:
    print("Biggest Number is:", a)
elif b>c:
    print("Biggest Number is:", b)
else:
    print("Biggest Number is:", c)

Example-3
----------
Program: Marks → Total, Avg and Grade
s1 = int(input("Enter Sub-1 Marks: "))
s2 = int(input("Enter Sub-2 Marks: "))
s3 = int(input("Enter Sub-3 Marks: "))

total = s1 + s2 + s3
avg = total/3
print("Total Marks:", total)
print("Average:", avg)

if avg >= 70:
    print("Grade A")
elif avg >= 60 and avg < 70:
    print("Grade B")
elif avg >= 50 and avg < 60:
    print("Grade C")
else:
    print("Grade D")

Example-4
----------
Program: Number to Word (1–3)
n = int(input("Enter any Number: "))
if n == 1:
    print("ONE")
elif n == 2:
    print("TWO")
elif n == 3:
    print("THREE")
else:
    print("Invalid Choice")



