4. Multiple if
--------------
--> If you have more than one if then it is called as multiple if.
Example
------
n = 5
if n >= 3:
    n = n + 5
if n >= 7:
    n = n - 2
print(n)

5. Nested if
-----------
--> A if inside of another if is called as nested if.
Example1-
---------
Program: Check if number is positive, negative, or zero

n = int(input('Enter any Number : '))
if n != 0:
    if n > 0:
        print('+Ve Number')
    else:
        print('-Ve Number')
else:
    print('Given Number is Zero')

